# Present Sir — CloudShift Deployment

Server: `192.168.1.150` | Path: `/data/apps/face-mark-presence-system`

## Ports

| Service | Port |
|---------|------|
| Backend (FastAPI) | 8001 |
| Frontend (Vite) | 8080 |
| PostgreSQL | 5432 / `presentsir` |

## Env files (server)

- Backend: `/data/apps/face-mark-presence-system/backend/.env`
- Frontend: `/data/apps/face-mark-presence-system/.env.local` → `VITE_API_URL=` (empty), `VITE_PROXY_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:8001`
- Backend CORS must include `https://facemark.app.cloudshiftsolutions.in`

## Start on server

```bash
/data/scripts/start_presence_system.sh
# or all services:
/data/scripts/start_all_services.sh
```

Scripts are installed from `home-server-dashboard` repo: `bash deploy/scripts/install-server.sh`

## Logs

- `/data/logs/face-backend.log`
- `/data/logs/face-frontend.log`
- `/data/logs/face-tunnel.log`

## New project standard

When creating a new CloudShift app repo, follow the same pattern documented in `home-server-dashboard/docs/DEPLOYMENT.md` and register in `home-server-dashboard/deploy/projects.json`.
